# Parameters of the second held-out sample of docs/mutation-push.md (section 10): drawn
# like the first (campaign-heldout.env, section 9) with another seed, without the
# (mode, cell, port) of any mutant of the push, of its section 8 or of the first held-out
# sample, and run under the 118-test suite (the 109 tests of section 9 and the five
# test_spec_* modules of section 10). Source campaign.env first (its CAMP holds the
# campaign's design/: base.il, sel/, mutations.tsv), then campaign-heldout.env (quotas,
# proof options), then this file, then run the commands of docs/mutation-push.md
# section 10.9.
#
# the test tree as run: b37c0ee with the test_spec_* modules and the test/Makefile module
# lists of section 10, which were not yet committed (file hashes:
# results/heldout2-b37c0ee/testtree.sha256); a commit that contains them gives the same
# tree. Its src/protocol_emulator_core.v is the campaign's core (sha256 26a873db...)
HEAD2_COMMIT=b37c0ee
# base seed: region k of HELDOUT_QUOTAS (k = 1, 2, ...) uses seed HELDOUT2_SEED + k for
# `mutate -list` (its cnot control bits) and for Python's random.Random(...).sample
HELDOUT2_SEED=20261001
# excluded besides the campaign's mutations.tsv: the eight mutants of section 8, and the
# first held-out sample (its mutations.tsv, sha256 80f83001...; the draw of section 9.6
# reproduces it byte for byte)
HELDOUT2_EXCLUDE_S8=campaigns/mutation/results/heldout-56f4b20/exclude_section8.tsv
HELDOUT2_EXCLUDE_H1=$HELDOUT/sample/mutations.tsv
# the work directory as run, and a fresh one for a re-run
HELDOUT2_DIR=${PE_WORK:?set PE_WORK to the cluster work directory}/gap-close/ho2
HELDOUT2=${PE_WORK:?set PE_WORK to the cluster work directory}/mutation-heldout2
# controls (second-sample ids, random.Random(20261001), ids sorted as integers, from the
# pools after the equiv_mutant.py job): for the miter, six killed by test_smoke and six
# proven by equiv_mutant.py; for equiv_inv.py, three more killed by test_smoke
HELDOUT2_FORMAL_CONTROLS="553 644 708 1413 1587 1722 490 574 586 605 669 1140"
HELDOUT2_EINV_CONTROLS="151 504 1007"
# Simulator: as campaign-heldout.env (Icarus Verilog 13.0 wrappers in $PE_WORK/cocotb/bin,
# cocotb 2.0.1 in $PE_WORK/cocotb/venv20). Mutant 1781 cannot be built (Yosys asserts on
# its memory read port); stage suite reports it as error and section 10 leaves it out.
